    "universal_formula": "χ^{1-dim}(β_K) = ∏_i V̂_i^{1-dim}  for any A (any number of generators).  Multiplicative property of 1-dim Wedderburn irreps.  Verified at A=1 (proton, neutron sym + alt) and A=2 (deuteron sym, alt) to ~1e-14 precision.  An earlier Σ_pair form was a degenerate special case at A=1 (only 2 generators → 1 pair → sum coincides with product); the product formula is the universal one.",
